---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import Figure from "../components/Figure.astro";
---

<Page
	title="About us"
	description="Aequus Archers is a friendly, volunteer-run target archery club in Milford, Derbyshire, welcoming archers of every age and ability since 2012."
	intro="A friendly, volunteer-run target archery club in Milford, Derbyshire — welcoming archers of every age and ability since 2012."
>
	<section class="has-figure">
		<Figure
			src="/images/community/our-story.jpg"
			alt="Aequus Archers members over the years"
			caption="Archers of every age and ability — the club since 2012."
			align="right"
		/>
		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>
			Founded in 2012 by a passionate group of coaches, Aequus Archers exists to promote archery as
			a sport for everyone — irrespective of age, gender, ethnicity, background or circumstance.
		</p>
		<p>
			Our name says it all: <em>aequus</em> is Latin for even, calm, equal, favourable, just and fair
			— the spirit we try to bring to every session.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>What we offer</h2>
		<p>
			Whether you’re curious to try something new or ready to take it further, there’s a welcoming
			way in.
		</p>
		<div class="offer-grid">
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Taster sessions</h3>
				<p class="muted">A one-off 1.5-hour session to give archery a go. All equipment provided.</p>
				<a class="offer-link" href="/sessions">See dates →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Beginner’s courses</h3>
				<p class="muted">
					Four weekend sessions to learn the fundamentals and earn your Archery GB certificate.
				</p>
				<a class="offer-link" href="/sessions">See dates →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="offer">
				<h3>Membership</h3>
				<p class="muted">Completed a course? Join us and shoot regularly through the season.</p>
				<a class="offer-link" href="#membership">How to join →</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="membership">
		<h2>Becoming a member</h2>
		<p>
			To join an Archery GB–affiliated club like ours, you first need to complete a beginner’s
			course and receive your certificate. Once you have it, you’re welcome to join Aequus Archers
			and shoot with us regularly throughout the season.
		</p>
		<p class="note">
			Membership fees and how to pay are managed through the club — get in touch and we’ll talk
			you through it.
		</p>
		<a class="btn" href="/contact">Ask about membership</a>
	</section>

	<section id="location" class="has-figure">
		<h2>Where to find us</h2>
		<Figure
			src="/images/community/the-field.jpg"
			alt="The Aequus Archers outdoor field at Milford, Derbyshire"
			caption="Our outdoor field at Milford — free parking and a warm welcome."
			align="left"
		/>
		<p>
			All sessions take place at our outdoor field in Milford, Derbyshire, during the summer
			season. Free parking and a warm welcome await.
		</p>
		<p class="note">
			Exact directions, parking details and a map will be added here — for now, please <a
				href="/contact">contact us</a
			> if you need help finding us.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="outro">
		<h2>Come and have a go</h2>
		<p style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
			Beginners are always welcome — pick a taster or course date to get started.
		</p>
		<a class="btn" href="/sessions">View upcoming sessions</a>
	</section>

	<style>
		.offer-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
			gap: 28px;
			margin-top: 20px;
		}
		.offer {
			border-top: 2px solid var(--aeq-line);
			padding-top: 14px;
		}
		.offer-link {
			display: inline-block;
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 1.0625rem;
			color: var(--aeq-accent-text);
			text-decoration: none;
			padding: 8px 0;
		}
		.offer-link:hover {
			text-decoration: underline;
		}
		.outro {
			text-align: center;
			padding-top: 36px;
			border-top: 2px solid var(--aeq-line);
		}
	</style>
</Page>
